      "translation": "A shelf for exchanging books appeared at our school. Every pupil can bring a book they have read and take another. On Monday I left a travel story there and chose a book about animals. Inside was a note from the previous reader: he recommended starting with the chapter about birds. I followed his advice and learned a lot. Now I want to write a short note for the next reader too. The teacher asked us not to write on the books’ pages, but to use separate sheets. That way the books will stay clean longer.",
